        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "MR 2 ID 100 is the most powerful of the MR 2 family, with 15 kN of feed and retract force and 3,500 Nm of torque. The frame stands on three swivelling supports that follow uneven ground and turn 90 degrees for sideways moves. The feed is hydraulic with a built-in cylinder, and the rig takes hydraulic rotary heads for down-the-hole hammers up to 5 inches or a hydro-pneumatic drifter.",
